    "description": "AST-expansion conformance fixture for grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/weno5_eno1_norm_D2_extrapolate_bc: a minimal consuming model binding NX=NY=8 at the import edge (the smallest even size on which every region of the rule is non-empty). The match on the COMPOUND hybrid WENO5/ENO1 gradient magnitude sqrt((D(u,x))^2 + (D(u,y))^2) (priority 20) fires through the section-9.6.3 fixpoint and lowers to the rule's body -- sqrt(Mx^2 + My^2) with Mx, My the two per-axis seven-region makearrays -- with the imported stencils inlined, the free names dx, dy, wind_u, wind_v, bdy_eno1_cells, weno_band_cells left symbolic, all metaparameters folded, zero apply_expression_template nodes, zero unlowered rewrite-target ops. wind_u = 1, wind_v = 0.5 constant fields; bdy_eno1_cells = 3, weno_band_cells = 4 (parameters). x0=y0=0, dx=dy=1/8 spelled with the literal 8 (grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm contract). The golden pins the byte-identical post-lowering AST across bindings.",
    "license": "MIT",
